{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"REM Compare different methods\n\nPROFILE START \"Method1\"\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  height = SIN(i * 0.05) * 30 + SIN(i * 0.02) * 50\nNEXT i\nPROFILE END \"Method1\"\n\nPROFILE START \"Method2\"\nREM Pre-calculate outside loop\nFOR i = 0 TO 1000\n  angle1 = i * 0.05\n  angle2 = i * 0.02\n  height = SIN(angle1) * 30 + SIN(angle2) * 50\nNEXT i\nPROFILE END \"Method2\"\n\nPRINT \"Method1 time: \" & TIME_Method1 & \" ms\"\nPRINT \"Method2 time: \" & TIME_Method2 & \" ms\"\nPRINT \"Speedup: \" & TIME_Method1 / TIME_Method2 & \"x\""}